<http://www.spektrix.com/capilanouniversity/event/24001ABMNLGCGVMRMGTMJKPBQCNHQQLMH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Fable Tour: Forever";
  schema:description """
	 ON SALE AUG 21<span><br/></span><h1>Rocky Riobo Music</h1><h2>The Fable Tour: Forever</h2><span><br/></span>Forever is the opening chapter of The Fable Tour—a year-long theatrical concert experience unfolding across four emotional chapters. Each performance explores a different stage of identity, transformation, and becoming, creating one larger story told over the course of a year.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In Forever, Rocky celebrates the people, places, and memories that continue to shape who she is today. Through original music, reimagined jazz standards, storytelling, dance, and theatrical design, this chapter explores family, heritage, belonging, and the quiet ways love echoes across generations. It is a reminder that the stories we carry become the foundation for everything that follows.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Warm, nostalgic, and deeply personal, Forever invites you into the beginning of a journey that unfolds throughout The Fable Tour. While each chapter stands on its own, together they tell one evolving story of identity, transformation, and becoming.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Purchase a package of 4 Adult tickets and save 5.00 a ticket! Discount calculated at checkout.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing Information:</h2><span><br/></span>•	Standard: $30 plus s/c<span><br/></span>•	Student/Senior: $25 plus s/c<span><br/></span>•	Family Package: $100 plus s/c<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>•	<span class=\"BoldText\">Gems Club</span> Premium seating: $75 plus s/c. Includes Exclusive   Welcome Package and Commemorative Keepsake <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>•	<span class=\"BoldText\">Fable Founders Pass</span> Premium seating: $125 plus s/c. Includes Exclusive Merchandise Package and Commemorative Opening Night Experience <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Community Rental Event</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://rockyriobomusic.com\">Artist Website</a>
""";
